          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "wizard-dougal:1wun0m3:1v1fsxm",
              "html": "You need four free spaces in your inventory for Dougal to give you items. If he doesn&#39;t give you the items, he will not accept the steam runes.",
              "text": "You need four free spaces in your inventory for Dougal to give you items. If he doesn't give you the items, he will not accept the steam runes.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "wizard-dougal:10k9kd3",
          "html": "Wear the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Binding_necklace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">binding necklace</a> that Dougal gave you.",
          "text": "Wear the binding necklace that Dougal gave you.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "wizard-dougal:92tvx1",
          "html": "Craft at least one <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Steam_rune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">steam rune</a>. The remaining runes (4 steam runes, 5 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mind_rune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mind runes</a>, 5 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Body_rune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">body runes</a>) can be obtained or bought ahead of time.",
          "text": "Craft at least one steam rune. The remaining runes (4 steam runes, 5 mind runes, 5 body runes) can be obtained or bought ahead of time.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "wizard-dougal:92tvx1:7jbfnx",
              "html": "Steam runes can be crafted by using <b>fire runes</b> on the <b><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Water_altar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">water altar</a></b> (consuming a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fire_talisman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fire talisman</a>).",
              "text": "Steam runes can be crafted by using fire runes on the water altar (consuming a fire talisman).",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "wizard-dougal:92tvx1:ywkxq9",
              "html": "Alternatively, use <b>water runes</b> on the <b><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fire_altar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fire altar</a></b> (consuming a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Water_talisman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">water talisman</a>).",
              "text": "Alternatively, use water runes on the fire altar (consuming a water talisman).",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "wizard-dougal:1jpqa5t",
          "html": "Talk to Wizard Dougal.",
          "text": "Talk to Wizard Dougal.",
          "dialogue": [],
