        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "wizard-shug:mbjlh0",
          "html": "Obtain five <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pizazz_points\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pizazz points</a> from <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mage_Training_Arena\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mage Training Arena</a> minigame, if you don&#39;t already have five. <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Enchantment_Pizazz_points\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Enchantment Pizazz points</a> are easy to obtain by casting any level jewellery enchantment spell (<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lvl-1_Enchant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lvl-1 Enchant</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lvl-2_Enchant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lvl-2 Enchant</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lvl-3_Enchant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lvl-3 Enchant</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lvl-4_Enchant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lvl-4 Enchant</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lvl-5_Enchant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lvl-5 Enchant</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lvl-6_Enchant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lvl-6 Enchant</a>) on a dragonstone lying on the arena floor. (Requires at least level 7 Magic.)",
          "text": "Obtain five pizazz points from Mage Training Arena minigame, if you don't already have five. Enchantment Pizazz points are easy to obtain by casting any level jewellery enchantment spell (Lvl-1 Enchant, Lvl-2 Enchant, Lvl-3 Enchant, Lvl-4 Enchant, Lvl-5 Enchant, Lvl-6 Enchant) on a dragonstone lying on the arena floor. (Requires at least level 7 Magic.)",
